WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:10.980
Attends,

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.880
je crois que t’as un moustique.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:14.700
Sur la joue, là.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:15.500
Ok,

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:16.980
vas-y.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.580
C’est bon, tu l’as eu

00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:58.560
Ouais,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:00:59.380
je crois ouais.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:00.560
Merci,

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:02.120
t’es un pote.

